Length [text box] - Track
Type the Length of the Track into the text box.
Remarks
After you inserted it, Plant Simulation shows its length here. The length of the Track and the sum of the
lengths of all Transporters located on it determine how many Transporters it can accommodate at any one
time.
You can change the length of the graphic and the anchor points of the Track by clicking Show
Manipulators 
  on the Edit ribbon tab or by pressing M on the keyboard.
